  "date": "October 2026",
  "abstract": "Covers the C2PA Technical Specification (Content Credentials) at version 2.4: the C2PA Manifest Store in JUMBF and external application/c2pa stores, standard, update and compressed manifests, claim v2, assertions (actions with digitalSourceType for AI-generated content, AI Disclosure, ingredient v3, data, box, BMFF and collection hash bindings, soft bindings and watermarks, thumbnails, metadata, time-stamp and certificate status), COSE claim signatures with X.509 certificates, RFC 3161 time-stamps and OCSP stapling, validator trust configuration with the C2PA Trust List and TSA Trust List, the Well-Formed, Valid and Trusted states and the validation algorithm with its status codes, the Conformance Program v0.2 additional requirements, and the C2PA guidance for AI and ML. Version lines: 2.4 is current, 2.3 and 2.2 are supported, 2.1, 2.0 and 1.4 (standing for 1.0 to 1.4, claim v1) are legacy, with upgrade checklists; no draft is published. SKILL.md holds the invariants and workflow; references split out the version lines, manifests and claims, assertions, signing and trust, and validation.",
